Description: Read and write files in the 'Apache Parquet' columnar storage
    format. Provides a native interface built on the fast C-based 'carquet'
    library. Bundles its C dependencies to avoid external runtime library
    requirements other than system 'zlib'.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
SystemRequirements: GNU make, zlib
